# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Git already stores these as LF, but with core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout
# converts them to CRLF, and gofmt then reports every single .go file as
# unformatted even though the content is byte-identical to its own output. That
# makes the `gofmt -l` gate in .github/workflows/go.yml impossible to reproduce
# locally on Windows: it passes on the Linux runner and fails on the contributor's
# machine, for no real reason.
*.go    text eol=lf
*.mod   text eol=lf
*.sum   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf

# Binary, never touch.
*.png   binary
*.exe   binary
*.svg   text eol=lf
